Description: Adapt to eclib using INT class for scalar
 In newer eclib versions, scalar is INT (a wrapper around FLINT's fmpz)
 rather than int. Update Cython declarations and conversions.
Author: Debian Science Maintainers
Forwarded: https://github.com/sagemath/sage/issues

